{"speciesId":587,"names":{"fr":"Emolga","es":"Emolga","en":"Emolga","ja":"エモンガ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Il accumule dans ses membranes l’électricité qu’il produit dans ses bajoues, et la relâche tout en planant."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"The energy made in its cheeks’ electric pouches is stored inside its membrane and released while it is gliding."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Il vit au sommet des arbres de la forêt. Il plane en déchargeant l’électricité de ses membranes semblables à une cape."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"They live on treetops and glide using the inside of a cape-like membrane while discharging electricity."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"It glides on its outstretched membrane while shocking foes with the electricity stored in the pouches on its cheeks."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"It glides on its outstretched membrane while shocking foes with the electricity stored in the pouches on its cheeks."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Il vit au sommet des arbres de la forêt. Il plane en déchargeant l’électricité de ses membranes semblables à une cape."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Vive en la copa de los árboles. Produce descargas mientras vuela con el interior de la membrana que hace de capa."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"They live on treetops and glide using the inside of a cape-like membrane while discharging electricity."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"森の 木の上で 暮らす。 マントのような 膜の 内側を 放電 させながら 滑空する。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Il accumule dans ses membranes l’électricité qu’il produit dans ses bajoues, et la relâche tout en planant."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Almacena en una membrana la electricidad generada por sus mejillas y planea por los aires soltando descargas."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"The energy made in its cheeks’ electric pouches is stored inside its membrane and released while it is gliding."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"ほほの 電気袋で 作った 電気を 膜の 内側に ためて 滑空しながら 電気を 放つ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Il vit au sommet des arbres de la forêt. Il plane en déchargeant l’électricité de ses membranes semblables à une cape."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Vive en la copa de los árboles. Produce descargas mientras vuela con el interior de la membrana que hace de capa."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"They live on treetops and glide using the inside of a cape-like membrane while discharging electricity."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"森の 木の上で 暮らす。 マントのような 膜の 内側を 放電 させながら 滑空する。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Il accumule dans ses membranes l’électricité qu’il produit dans ses bajoues, et la relâche tout en planant."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Almacena en una membrana la electricidad generada por sus mejillas y planea por los aires soltando descargas."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"The energy made in its cheeks’ electric pouches is stored inside its membrane and released while it is gliding."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"ほほの 電気袋で 作った 電気を 膜の 内側に ためて 滑空しながら 電気を 放つ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sun","text":"Telle une cape de super-héros, sa membrane de peau lui permet de planer. Il décharge alors son électricité sur ses ennemis... et ses alliés."},{"language":"es","version":"sun","text":"Planea con su membrana, que hace las veces de capa. La electricidad que despide electrocuta sin distinción a enemigos y aliados."},{"language":"en","version":"sun","text":"It glides using its cape-like membrane. Electrical energy scatters from it, shocking its friends and foes alike."},{"language":"ja","version":"sun","text":"マントのような 膜で 滑空。 電気を まき散らして 敵も 味方も 感電 させまくる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"moon","text":"L’électricité lui sert à griller à point fruits et Pokémon Insecte. Il fait généralement son nid dans les arbres creusés par les Picassaut."},{"language":"es","version":"moon","text":"Suelta una descarga eléctrica para achicharrar bayas o Pokémon insecto. Suele habitar los nidos que los Pikipek horadan en los árboles."},{"language":"en","version":"moon","text":"It grills berries and bug Pokémon with electric shocks and makes a meal of them. It usually nests in the holes gouged in trees by Pikipek."},{"language":"ja","version":"moon","text":"電撃で 木の実や むしポケモンを こんがり 焼いて 喰う。 ツツケラが 空けた 木の穴が 主な 巣だ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Il plane dans les airs une fois qu’il est chargé en électricité. Les nuits où le tonnerre gronde, des centaines d’Emolga se regroupent dans le ciel."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Se carga de electricidad y se echa a volar. Durante las noches de tormenta eléctrica se los ve a centenares surcando el cielo."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"They store up electricity to fly through the air. When thunder cracks at night, sometimes there are almost enough of them to blot out the sky."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"電気を 蓄え 空を 飛ぶ。 雷が とどろく 真夜中には 空を 埋め尽くすほど いることも。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Les Pokémon oiseaux ne s’approchent pas de lui car il décharge de l’électricité en planant. Il peut donc garder sa nourriture pour lui tout seul."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Desprende descargas eléctricas mientras vuela, por lo que los Pokémon pájaro no se le acercan, y así puede quedarse la comida para él solo."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"As it flies, it scatters electricity around, so bird Pokémon keep their distance. That’s why Emolga can keep all its food to itself."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"電気を まき散らしながら 飛ぶので とりポケモンたちが 近付かない。 おかげで エサを ひとりじめできる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Il virevolte dans le ciel en libérant des gerbes d’électricité. Son vol est gracieux, mais peut s’avérer dangereux."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Planea por el aire, casi como si danzara, mientras desprende electricidad. Resulta adorable, pero puede causar bastantes problemas."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"As Emolga flutters through the air, it crackles with electricity. This Pokémon is cute, but it can cause a lot of trouble."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"電気を ほとばしらせながら 空を 舞うように 飛ぶ。 可愛いが やっかいなのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Les Baies sucrées sont son péché mignon. Il lui arrive d’en conserver beaucoup trop dans ses bajoues, ce qui l’empêche de bien planer."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Le encantan las bayas dulces. A veces almacena tanta comida en los carrillos que no puede volar bien."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"This Pokémon absolutely loves sweet berries. Sometimes it stuffs its cheeks full of so much food that it can’t fly properly."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"甘い 木の実が 大好物。 頬袋に エサを 溜めすぎ うまく 飛べないときも ある。"}],"varieties":[{"id":587,"moves":[{"name":"cut","learns":[[11,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0]]},{"name":"tail-whip","learns":[[11,"level-up",7],[14,"level-up",7],[15,"level-up",7],[16,"level-up",7],[17,"level-up",7],[18,"level-up",7],[20,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"solar-beam","learns":[[20,"machine",0],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"thunder-shock","learns":[[11,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",15]]},{"name":"thunderbolt","learns":[[11,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"thunder-wave","learns":[[11,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"thunder","learns":[[11,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[